<title>UK: Hambro near full control of RPT management.</title>
<headline>Hambro near full control of RPT management.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hambro Countrywide said on Wednesday it had received valid acceptances with respect to acquiring 90 percent of issued share capital in RPT Management Services Plc.</p>
<p>Hambro had offered 114 pence in cash for each RPT ordinary share, valuing RPT's share capital at about 8.4 billion stg.</p>
<p>RPT closed firm at 112 1/2 pence on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Hambro said it had sent notices to non-assenting RPT shareholders to acquire the outstanding issued ordinary shares.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
